---
description: Field product constraints
alwaysApply: true
---

Stack is Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind, and viem. The interface uses RetroUI (NeoBrutalism) components. Keep the MIT copyright notice in every copied RetroUI source file.

Field is bulk ENS lookup on Ethereum mainnet. The lookup lives in `src/lib/ens/`. Read-only. No wallet, no OpenSea, no Floor.

Never ask for or store a private key or seed.
